# Pure Real-World Catchment Map: Wuestebach / Rur TERENO (Eifel, Germany)
# 20 x 20 km (EPSG:25832, Center E=318000 N=5606000)
# DEM: NRW OpenGeodata DGM1 1.0m | Imagery: NRW DOP10 0.10m (2025)
# Adaptive Quadtree LOD 0..10 (down to 0.076 m/px in Wuestebach watershed core)
# Keys: Wheel=Zoom (adaptive LOD streaming), Right-Drag=Orbit, Middle-Drag=Pan, K=Cycle Contours (0/1/2), Home=Reset View
mode 3d
tab 0
draw 0
ground off
gimbal 1
hud 1
plot 0
text 0
terrain examples/demo/maps/wuestebach_de.epack
contours 1
camera -6000 -6000 260 0.52 -0.82 0.065 1
